    <!--
        Settings and proxy icons, drawn on a shared 24x24 grid so they keep the same optical weight next to
        each other. Filled paths rather than an icon font: Segoe MDL2 Assets and Segoe Fluent Icons are not
        the same font, are not present on every supported Windows build, and cannot be recoloured or scaled
        per state the way a Path can.

        Holes are cut with the nonzero rule (the F1 prefix), so an inner contour is wound against its outer
        one; overlapping contours of the same direction merge instead of cancelling.
    -->

